#: scenario5:scenario5_49EC72D7_464F_45AE_83CA_75CC4C81372F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13619c2174da1451e95e9f4e281ed52a6680dccb60f501d5eeeead2a5b747a1e
#. default-sha256: d1b1ad608c066c3ea25c32f1877f93ff92ca9a1a2d3b20d73d3df51ef0276174
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_49EC72D7_464F_45AE_83CA_75CC4C81372F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Several days had passed since the "
"package arrived; ⟪k:12⟫the end of my third week living in the mansion was drawing near."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫荷が運び込まれてから数日が経ち――、"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫私がこの館に来て、⟪k:14⟫二十日が経とうとしていた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6150F9D5_5DDC_43DF_A513_607F62A542F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 615298457a3cdb96eab2b34897b1dea2f2a404aeb423271aa4f78681e9859132
#. default-sha256: 2b49a27223237be84ff10f1b5583256be73ff9c1478a29199cb472b66387d549
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6150F9D5_5DDC_43DF_A513_607F62A542F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel wasn’t getting any friendlier, either. ⟪k:1⟫He continued to either snub or bluntly "
"dismiss me whenever we crossed paths."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あれ以降も、⟪k:1⟫ミシェルはずっと、⟪k:2⟫冷たい態度を取り続けた。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫私を疎み、⟪k:5⟫拒絶"
"し続ける言葉……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_653649AD_016A_4720_AF8F_1972915C5AE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01c25a3ed7302c11c17d65c6651de2358827c4de7ae395bb21910717df9dccd1
#. default-sha256: 55903bbdbbc061c7ac8cbda20cabb9935f0b2790104ba25eaa781fa58fe29921
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_653649AD_016A_4720_AF8F_1972915C5AE5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I didn’t understand why he acted that way around me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……彼がなぜ、⟪k:1⟫あんな態度を取ってくるのか、⟪k:2⟫分からない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A8D1483C_9648_4012_B28C_2634220D8C98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d8601303b56ae51cbc5c6c45b1aa1aa929a59197ba48d7cf47fb1de66ce5bbb
#. default-sha256: 7dbe7716de25bce004c31773532471d527db6133c22f4f615bfd3def88782737
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A8D1483C_9648_4012_B28C_2634220D8C98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But there was little point in asking when he seemed to think there was little point in "
"talking to me at all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫理由を問おうとしても、⟪k:1⟫会話になんてならない。⟪k:2⟫はなから、⟪k:3⟫私と言葉を交わすことが、"
"⟪k:4⟫無意味だと思っているように。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F46A383E_C563_49CD_9477_40CF746506DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27a7ec9ebb03e45f0710255e1141fe4a47281e7dbeb698a68c9bba7919f8027b
#. default-sha256: 42cb6557a0cf896c3ac813285185913c438719755ead4c81c67646f60fe6dc49
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F46A383E_C563_49CD_9477_40CF746506DB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Although at first I had been sure there was some way to get him to warm up to me,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫最初はどうにか、⟪k:1⟫距離を縮めようと思い続けていたのだけれど……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_424348E1_F5B1_4CF9_B0EF_CE05648831F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff6f08cea88664538a0b8d89b58ddbaf65c4ff97fc38efcfeabb4e50c394ae19
#. default-sha256: 6f49c2c57396cf365f93a79db7f5b3dec15f74d8646b6f0cf4b2f48c10fd717d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_424348E1_F5B1_4CF9_B0EF_CE05648831F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫the more time I spent in the mansion, the more my willpower began to feel like it was at its "
"breaking point."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼と過ごしたこの日々で。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫その心も、⟪k:3⟫考えも。⟪k:4⟫折れそうになっている自分がい"
"た。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_75DBADEE_BB49_47B3_98C8_A69797C4FF12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 201506d9a75cc9a1e8dd8cbd8ebb507223fe9290fe78323d1fb5e5d6f6225579
#. default-sha256: 8a553a2fe2c87b05309f9f4539389490c4044124efe7be763bbbcaa12bff1a09
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_75DBADEE_BB49_47B3_98C8_A69797C4FF12"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I could tell myself to stay positive until I was blue in the face,⟪k:1⟫but it would only "
"work for so long."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫いくら前向きになろうと思っていても……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫限界があったのだ。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B8A2906C_3079_44F8_ADFE_0610C9535338
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80de6b127ef952c542c07f473da1e9cfad5eb87711e2cbf82c6e5692ec9d0f9b
#. default-sha256: d210316c7fed7643ab9d4fd0f93e75972d8ac7530277a486948b8f70dced65ef
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B8A2906C_3079_44F8_ADFE_0610C9535338"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(The one pretty place in the whole house...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫（やっぱり、⟪k:2⟫ここは……、⟪k:3⟫ここだけは綺麗……）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9DED7EEC_0722_4C45_9EF7_A984612FE73D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80a671d64fcf07967da231e2e0306002387dc40633232867ee5a8a43d7e9f85d
#. default-sha256: 80f099bba848a48f38d58de87554973a10b44617700780779f0fda3e9b157d06
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9DED7EEC_0722_4C45_9EF7_A984612FE73D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I’m glad he hasn’t covered it back up.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（また隠されてなくてよかった……）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_65804540_F115_420D_AE61_DAB5CE7E94E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f073681061bc0b81d5189b6bf94bc2fb3bbad177d7a8ac2af7e9275fb83bd5f5
#. default-sha256: 0a9399368564c2b6d71b55f050ad9b01fdc37d7f795808ca28fd14d1857f8842
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_65804540_F115_420D_AE61_DAB5CE7E94E9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Blue moonlight shone quietly through the stained-glass window,⟪k:1⟫vainly illuminating some "
"of the room."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ステンドグラスは、⟪k:1⟫月明かりを背負っていた。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫青光りする虚ろな光が、⟪k:4⟫静かに注"
"ぎ込まれている。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B0B8F114_8698_4BC0_86F8_3007E9A895A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a246da8d3f4e1f3eebe40e0be409b8bcb028943450de1e03d98699f37e29d10
#. default-sha256: d027a3429b1584405b5059443f0ea7c36b4d1e0e593e520fc73ec5d49129247b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B0B8F114_8698_4BC0_86F8_3007E9A895A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I hadn’t noticed until now, but the room with the stained-glass window appeared to be "
"modeled after a chapel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫最初は気づかなかったけれど、⟪k:1⟫ステンドグラスのある部屋は、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫どうやら教会と同じ構造"
"のようだった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A0C7AE40_F8C8_4EDA_820A_38D0F5F09337
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5832623da440b127db344b4bf3ee492080a1349eeff88fe6eeadba71a9c42f9
#. default-sha256: 773a343eac3b359fa14306ae82f0bb98afd3dd9c9708a98c281416d264dea1df
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A0C7AE40_F8C8_4EDA_820A_38D0F5F09337"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Rows of pews faced the window, below which sat what used to be a pulpit."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫長椅子がステンドグラスに向かうように整列している。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫そして、⟪k:3⟫ステンドグラスの真下"
"には説教台――だったものが。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8C9CA69D_1F12_443C_9D1B_FEB57319275B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60ca69f22c2402e4738ef7a9e9a28df181584770d2e426aa3291b016f1c4e919
#. default-sha256: bddc7c8b5d2f8402a7bd8901712035170f26cd1878dd732a3094a7e604e1ffdc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8C9CA69D_1F12_443C_9D1B_FEB57319275B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was very little left of it, though, and an awkward length of silver was mounted to the "
"pulpit’s front face—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫過去形なのは、⟪k:1⟫つまり、⟪k:2⟫もう壊れかけているということ。⟪k:3⟫中途半端な長さの銀製の棒"
"が、⟪k:4⟫説教台にぽつんと残されている。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7264E601_7DDD_4CA2_9E95_82FC86D64C48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20930124e2a4fc31f9040a3bd5b2635da461929a6fe61b490a40618bd4a9c356
#. default-sha256: af1336597b67eb3689919d838790e6174f0a5b54fc0e7f06093176e8f2b4f13c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7264E601_7DDD_4CA2_9E95_82FC86D64C48"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫what was, I assumed, formerly a cross."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫たぶん、⟪k:1⟫あれは……十字架だったのだろう。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_CF7BE4A5_DE3F_454B_884D_538236B1ADDD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a7a6ee1ed9831d44aee0c012f3149431b441859f6a80e99321f8e720d59eecb3
#. default-sha256: dc1319721622b2192bcd09f00b58bd29e4022434b19add88472d9e2eef5ce17a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CF7BE4A5_DE3F_454B_884D_538236B1ADDD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Upon further reflection, rather than facing the window, the pews seemed to be pointed at the "
"pulpit—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or perhaps the cross hanging on it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫長椅子はステンドグラスを見ているというより、⟪k:1⟫説教台の神父様を――⟪k:2⟫あるいは十字架を、"
"⟪k:3⟫見つめている。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8806818E_A5AA_4012_BC56_0518E7F4D082
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b73344e16cf8d2b042f467e8badaf1aab9bfbdd35aba0d3d2a890dd42fd1a31
#. default-sha256: 96d64381b599726b696b23ce016db4dfa770435717f80a4c23aaa8d0e97cbe02
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8806818E_A5AA_4012_BC56_0518E7F4D082"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure why there would be a chapel in a mansion, but I had no one to ask about it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫どうして屋敷の中に、⟪k:1⟫教会なんてものがあるのか不思議に思ったけれど、⟪k:2⟫それを問うことも"
"出来なかった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_79CFBF33_6D18_4F97_81E6_C68B8B04EAB1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc9b76f43874e19520d9f20385ceff73ee6db54f324e7625f33e0a665e21c227
#. default-sha256: ebc67986a0950e1661fb9ce3cc6e95e9b2ffce99c01d8c98a667e2b41d77c7bf
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_79CFBF33_6D18_4F97_81E6_C68B8B04EAB1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(For a house of this size, a statue of Christ or the Virgin Mary seems more appropriate.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫（これくらいの規模の家なんだから、⟪k:1⟫キリスト様やマリア様の像を置くくらいでちょうどいいの"
"に）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_85244C87_58DA_4179_A1C6_C3252AEFA550
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e4ffbe099582630b125ffcdfbbb4c1fa96973b7981927e2f8ca3bb7918917e1
#. default-sha256: f5de1c85bb00703be46c6621ce202ed741107ba86ffd04aefd1937d5178cc62a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_85244C87_58DA_4179_A1C6_C3252AEFA550"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(It’s a very well made chapel, at any rate...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（ずいぶん、⟪k:1⟫しっかりと作られた部屋……）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9103FB9B_FF59_407A_B1F5_4CDFE900CFFD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea0379abd2c4e29ac353f07badabe55f404fc2ed3b8c29f0eaf8059fd410636a
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9103FB9B_FF59_407A_B1F5_4CDFE900CFFD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_D29F27E2_EC0C_4621_956D_C2A2CD962404
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c89cc9b1a03ebae3f3cdcffd890722c6670cdf95ca82c4b6564489a33381814
#. default-sha256: 89664f89a3236376b61610417ecdf7dac061681bbc85e3018ad3566dd5efd6f1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D29F27E2_EC0C_4621_956D_C2A2CD962404"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I doubted Michel had had it built for himself. ⟪k:1⟫There would be no reason for him to "
"cover the window if that were the case."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ミシェルが自分のために用意した部屋――とは思えなかった。⟪k:1⟫だってそうなら、⟪k:2⟫そもそもステ"
"ンドグラスを隠すなんてことはしないだろうし……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3A7A3407_AF3B_41E4_924C_5F34794B7486
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67a42849e44154b1e864c620d09fe17b16d069342d38814bea26935aa0374a2d
#. default-sha256: 4d63b60bd52a51f9d6f9e4f08c2465791ef8db99a0193ea548ea1dc1e9d60b29
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3A7A3407_AF3B_41E4_924C_5F34794B7486"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nor had I ever seen him come to pray."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼が祈りに来る現場も、⟪k:1⟫見たことがない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_BF6E0F10_588D_4AFA_9436_A66EFD5A59CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 822c07af8338793753dcab5add2ac65a480adfb331ad7a624e83e641db24a156
#. default-sha256: af5f55ddea278fe89f46ba867b358565531be7f289832efe04cd53e731b78745
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BF6E0F10_588D_4AFA_9436_A66EFD5A59CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(He doesn’t seem like one to believe in God.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（神様なんて、⟪k:1⟫信じてなさそう……）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0A56A746_2279_407F_84FC_A7A3CE7E50E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ee5b41df5c25cdeb94ed1533152990911b4035b147a4517fa4a3fbae6218e87
#. default-sha256: 0bcab97321a101635ee4d75af4d8c04d6b9c5488a873b0d914f635345f2441c3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0A56A746_2279_407F_84FC_A7A3CE7E50E5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(God...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（……神様、⟪k:1⟫か……）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E5007458_122E_4125_9932_037BFC3EE5D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7654ce2368df8e2c94ccdb073436978892987223ca7d2020801db598dc806cb
#. default-sha256: db9257be1448bdc08b3445b0110ad7b936effdbc966904de381f2acb611273c3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E5007458_122E_4125_9932_037BFC3EE5D4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I’m not even sure if I...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（わたしだって、⟪k:1⟫もう………）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F9324163_17D1_4F00_8DBD_339C28934087
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9afc0a03d40211f675028e70061cd8602f0f4d16b49e7e37732d6dbd9900e7e8
#. default-sha256: 46cb5a9700648c142705402aa6e63fef7c5dd57393463c70cd597c90ecebde95
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F9324163_17D1_4F00_8DBD_339C28934087"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If God ⟪k:1⟫really⟪k:2⟫ existed, then surely the world would be a much more pleasant, "
"peaceful place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫もし本当に神様がこの世に存在するのなら。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫この世はもっと平穏に満ちているはずなのに――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B5F3B961_B5CF_45E1_9686_D8F1AD89AF1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 81f88ac9a914f988886e7bf79cb7d7ee8641d4f2e8c29b327c6330f7f081adaf
#. default-sha256: 98c1ab7d907a4e2bd58bff78a4863ddabbbec729e5269441f214161366435a27
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B5F3B961_B5CF_45E1_9686_D8F1AD89AF1C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No unfair disparities in money or power. ⟪k:1⟫No senseless misfortune.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I certainly "
"wouldn’t have found myself here, either..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫理不尽な格差もなく。⟪k:1⟫理不尽な運命もなく。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫わたしがここにいることもなく……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_41BF1485_75AA_4EEA_940F_4F8D64CB0688
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
