"My father had passed away in a plague, so it was just me, my mother, and my older sister."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……わたしは、⟪k:3⟫首都の表通りに店を構える、⟪k:4⟫商家の娘だった。⟪k:5⟫父親は流行病で"
"死に、⟪k:6⟫母とわたし、⟪k:7⟫姉の三人暮らしだった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5A82401E_5D9A_4708_898A_C2F4F14E7BCC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b747d1351f901bb3f84a0ce0a4537bf2e6cad5b91957832d8cdd93c0b0b35f45
#. default-sha256: 502eb996f63b7f19d1fd0ab9e1bd8dabd3d5554fb30452f8b2c590e9f529e129
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5A82401E_5D9A_4708_898A_C2F4F14E7BCC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It would be a lie to say business was doing well."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫店の経営が上手くいっていたとはお世辞にも言えない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_CF63D0AB_643C_4138_8E9E_91DC1B719EC0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2341bac2729fb7162f48e57a0199e418d8c04855a3440d9e3c47fdaf2773c4fb
#. default-sha256: 600a6d68163aba531dc83d35f45e1e3a8439463bee3c1eb638e2ccc9f10b4519
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CF63D0AB_643C_4138_8E9E_91DC1B719EC0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We struggled to squeak by day-to-day after taxes...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but we couldn’t just abandon "
"the shop and leave the capital either..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫領主に収める税金で、⟪k:1⟫日々の生活が苦しいばかりで……。⟪k:2⟫けれど、⟪k:3⟫店を捨てて首都から立"
"ち去るわけにもいかず……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_778A2AAE_CCB7_42BA_B2C6_85F3D97DBA6F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de63ba22bbc850cfec4ba33d259fb13fc1d3ffe71c3aa51d7a6f65813ccd3175
#. default-sha256: 9d08b8a9b3007f91f3d98c2b9cc39bdacb9294d094dcd50de6663a2bbc75df86
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_778A2AAE_CCB7_42BA_B2C6_85F3D97DBA6F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫so we tried to make the best of what we were able to take in between the three of us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫三人でどうにか日々の糧を分け与えるような、⟪k:1⟫質素な暮らし。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0A4E61B0_4FB0_44B4_A6E4_86DA8AEAA2BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f432dad364da0cac355b59ecb030156841db3c8dd8f44cd61a0f4a1ddd807441
#. default-sha256: c0c19c2d3c02905725a2ae6c79cb1170cae7fb0ed940e88510871f0f25412da9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0A4E61B0_4FB0_44B4_A6E4_86DA8AEAA2BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Then, my sister fell in love with a moderately well-off aristocrat. ⟪k:1⟫Both my mom and I "
"were supportive of her and her desire to marry."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そんな中、⟪k:1⟫姉が恋に落ちたのは、⟪k:2⟫中流貴族の相手だった。⟪k:3⟫わたしも母も心から祝福し"
"て、⟪k:4⟫二人の結婚を望んだ。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_CE4F5CD4_0E48_451B_9DA3_6F0C0607605C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed4e3630b6e17633a21e2146eec2544b5a2ebae5217f3f62ef38b49392446069
#. default-sha256: 290d8d84c4a97993898d6363f11615501a4a5e3f2eebec42d3083a310dabb18f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CE4F5CD4_0E48_451B_9DA3_6F0C0607605C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But their union almost fell apart because she was “not suitable” for him. ⟪k:1⟫Merchants "
"were hardly the lowest class—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫けれど、⟪k:1⟫釣り合わないという理由でその縁談は流れそうになった。⟪k:2⟫商家は決して身分が低す"
"ぎるというわけじゃない――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0949ED31_09F9_472D_B559_50857937E097
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3a18173b39a39ed8e2bb64f8deb8c6d64ae1b77de493cd758578965173db3fd
#. default-sha256: 27638ab125fcc99d3e517d081d5cb5f31b7cafe07d74b745277a516b139117e0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0949ED31_09F9_472D_B559_50857937E097"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫what we lacked, instead, was wealth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫足りないのは、⟪k:1⟫わたしたちの資金だった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_544B30C8_2862_43A1_8AF6_ABB4BC74ACEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c34f4f1498a8d7333b8b8b1552427a8c45e037bc882881536b13c5aea6c07111
#. default-sha256: 3bba55aa8a7f186a8f87566c38298a8c078291e6d9f5d7c0f58391570b6888aa
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_544B30C8_2862_43A1_8AF6_ABB4BC74ACEF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We needed another source of money, beyond what the shop took in."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……お金が必要だった。⟪k:1⟫商売だけでなく、⟪k:2⟫それ以外で得られるようなものが。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2950F572_63BF_42D2_90BD_943E614D3831
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7a5873e980ccbcf4aeb7c4b8754e0d1794c1b0f6e6126fb1a20d273b6b90a24
#. default-sha256: 7ea965d1cf36bd26da3485549d228afde621a1d6e69b06dc903aa4d5fd9f2ab1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2950F572_63BF_42D2_90BD_943E614D3831"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If only we had money, my sister could get married.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If only we had money, my mom "
"wouldn’t have to work so hard."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫お金さえあれば、⟪k:1⟫姉は結婚が出来るのだろう。⟪k:2⟫お金さえあれば、⟪k:3⟫母も楽になるのだろ"
"う。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0F44F0A0_0406_4329_AD33_CC802B3A9D7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c40b515a17e7cae55b401dec4dac9f1e6d7fa86a3dfe72ab88e80e8070bfc11
#. default-sha256: 839bdb08d35f6287c4cd174545746a8ba87fddaed9d9a9075c9834c343aa04a0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0F44F0A0_0406_4329_AD33_CC802B3A9D7E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If only we had money..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫お金さえあれば……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C4EE351D_0501_4EFB_A7FD_2274198C4767
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf03c01b88f5b4bcd6c7c81a9402ddcfec6dc64b64409ec55d3fa134968dbcac
