msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C4EE351D_0501_4EFB_A7FD_2274198C4767"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was then that someone from the distinguished Bollinger estate approached me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……名家の貴族であるボランジェ家から声がかかったのは、⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ちょうどその頃だった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_631D3376_1203_4553_AAA4_E3A30A8168E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f729102631bc81ee37f3a26b3bfd5b61cdd1531b8e75f2aacec7db5e26dca9f0
#. default-sha256: 931ff37fd8cc569eabe9b98b0417273d679caf633fda110f9e1fbbd83932d80f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_631D3376_1203_4553_AAA4_E3A30A8168E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He said they were in need of abigails and would love to have me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He said that if I "
"agreed to work for them, the Bollinger estate would take care of my family."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫侍女が足りないから、⟪k:1⟫ぜひ家に来て欲しいと――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫承諾してくれれば、⟪k:4⟫家の面倒は引"
"き受けよう、⟪k:5⟫と……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_60CFB76B_A66C_410C_8351_588DB472D762
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6bd23574e4725ec48612d5b4b6044ce48ed3e619788eef7aa3515c31b80cfb18
#. default-sha256: 005acdcabcf14b56c0ef58248b6f56d67596ae71d696cff34fec8fd0663a0e49
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_60CFB76B_A66C_410C_8351_588DB472D762"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Generally speaking, noble houses took abigails from other, lower-ranked noble houses. ⟪k:1⟫"
"It was unthinkable for someone of my status to receive such an offer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫本来、⟪k:1⟫侍女として奉公に上がるのは、⟪k:2⟫貴族階級の人間が相応しい。⟪k:3⟫わたしのような人間"
"に声がかかるなんて、⟪k:4⟫思ってもみなかった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_122E592A_6FF7_4F3E_B4FF_E5AA136890FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d9a8ff634d2ca11fc26ed5ca49dd61cd1a8e2035dad18285d2630f5f4e690f3
#. default-sha256: bd67a17e32c559c0f72307af8d0bb0a08602f1ddb3b6d922939b9ea7ecc3fbb5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_122E592A_6FF7_4F3E_B4FF_E5AA136890FA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I took it as a once-in-a-lifetime chance and accepted the offer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫だから、⟪k:1⟫わたしはまたとない僥倖なのだと思い――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫使者の言葉に、⟪k:4⟫頷いたのだ……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C43E5546_3335_4B5F_9323_F902B92345DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 608a5236932b9326b78e4524518bc75ad2210c3e0d14e305ea99737f7844503c
