msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I just pray that nothing bad happens to my sister..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……せめて、⟪k:2⟫姉さんが嫁ぎ先で嫌な目に遭っていないように……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6AB4DCD8_0741_45CB_8FA9_F2C0F316B38E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6c17cd9a91a6535bf6f4590225687f65b1d48af35b52a285e662d78e482e834b
