msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It felt like a message from on high—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫that no, my prayers would not be "
"answered."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫わたしの祈りなど聞き遂げないとでも言うように。"

